    "checks": [
      "LoadScene retains SceneDocument load and package digest verification before GPU creation; ResolveNetworkBindings relies on this loaded scene and draw metadata, not ClientSession state.",
      "The initial ClientSnapshot is empty. DrawTransform copies the asset world matrix and finds no network entity, preserving the authored first-frame transforms.",
      "Run submits the first successful frame, flushes graphics and compute queues, then creates the session and verifies its package digest before setting the started flag.",
      "Tick, movement pulses, reconnect requests and network samples are gated on the started flag and therefore first run in the next event loop.",
      "Minimized startup waits to render and initialize. Once initialized, network Tick still executes before the minimized-window continue path.",
      "Failed initialization is transactional in ClientSession; digest mismatch exits with failure and RAII destroys the session. Successful drain is tested immediately after Tick and exits before another Tick."
    ],
    "execution_boundary": "Final4 exact-binary network warmup, real input, reconnect and minimized progress evidence is linked separately. The video covers initial motion only."
